<div class="slide__description"><div class="views-field views-field-field-hero-teaser"><div class="field-content"><div class="slide__teaser">
  <p>This month, PHSC honors the courage, service, and sacrifice of U.S. service members, veterans, and their families in celebration of Veterans Appreciation Month. </p>
